and crop-time inference) depends on Ultralytics software licensed under
AGPL-3.0. Combining that path with this repository for distribution may
impose AGPL obligations on the combined work. First-party MIT code does not
relicense Ultralytics.

Noodle Tracer RGB encoder
-------------------------
The Noodle Tracer RGB encoder uses torchvision's MobileNetV3-Small with
ImageNet-pretrained weights (MobileNet_V3_Small_Weights.DEFAULT).
